<title>UK: TABLE-Waddington yr pretax rises 25 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Waddington yr pretax rises 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 29, 1997</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		21.57		  vs 17.89</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.0		    vs 5.4</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 10.4		   vs 9.4</p>
<p> Pretax pre-exceps	32.1		   vs 25.6</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    32.1		   vs 11.9</p>
<p> Exceptional items	0			vs 13.76</p>
<p> Turnover		   310.4		  vs 298.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said the strong pound cut sales by 8.0 million stg and operating profits by 900,000 stg when compared to the previous year's average exchange rates. Full name of the British specialist printing and board manufacturer is Waddington Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
